# "Seek out — Whenever you draw your second card each turn, Ro Laren deals 2 damage to each opponent." On turn 3 Bot1's
# draw step is the first card of the turn and Ro Laren's own ability the second, so the trigger deals 2 damage to Bot2 as it
# resolves (CR 603.2, 120.3) - damage to each opponent, never to a creature: Bot2's Ornithopter is undamaged and Bot1's own
# life is untouched. The ability could not be used on turn 1, when the creature still had summoning sickness (CR 302.6).

